的反擊"]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["五丈原  曹操军主营"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":1999,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[596],[]]},"end":131,"end_off":2912},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["處理完左慈引發的事件後，\n許子將施法將曹操等人傳送至五丈原，\n曹操等人與魔王之間的決戰也即將\n開始了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n既然左慈已被打敗，\n那麼我也要暫時退場了。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[157,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n別擔心，我還會回來客串的。\n嘿、嘿、嘿。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[829,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王朗\n總之，老夫的戲份就到此為止了，\n掰掰！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n嗯，再見。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n後會有期喽！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王朗\n正所謂有朋自遠方來，不亦樂乎……"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,157,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,829,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王朗\n喂喂喂！老夫的話還沒說完呢，\n別隨便打斷老夫說話呀！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[804,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n（呼，總算不用聽他說教了。）"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[804,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王朗\n真是的，你們都不懂得敬老尊賢呀？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n別鬧，我這個沒出現的都沒說話了呢。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&卖萌小子\n哈哈，這樣一來我的任務就結束了。\n881！"]},{"op":22,"name":"info","args":["左慈事件已解決，\n貂蟬裝備四神寶玉可再次學會\n策略「絕」。"]},{"op":114,"name":"ext_command","args":[10,"0\n0,79,17,129,64\n位置，特效，人物，裝備，效果值\n貂蟬裝備青龍寶玉學會策略「絕」"],"ext":{"sub":10,"fn":"equip_skill","nums":[0,0,79,17,129,64],"text":"位置，特效，人物，裝備，效果值\n貂蟬裝備青龍寶玉學會策略「絕」"}},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[23,54,22,2,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n主公，贾诩回来了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,23,0,54,52,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n……哦，貂蝉姑娘！\n妳已经回来了是吗？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n是的。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n喔，贾诩，辛苦你了。\n一切原委我已经听貂蝉说过了。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3230,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[596]]},"end":159,"end_off":3415},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n就在不久以前，我們還和魔王的爪牙\n進行了一場激戰呢。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n是。那么是否即刻出兵歼灭孔明……？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3415,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[596],[]]},"end":170,"end_off":3652},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n就在不久以前，我們還和魔王的爪牙\n進行了一場激戰呢。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n唉，看來我錯過了一場重要的戰鬥了。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n話說回來，\n我們是否即刻出兵歼灭孔明……？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n如今既然得知魔王不会复活，\n孔明也不足为惧了！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n主公还是不能大意啊。\n&贾诩\n其实属下在长安已经找到一些文献，\n记载着有关魔王复活之前的能力。\n&贾诩\n文献指出除了木人与土偶之外，\n魔王還能不斷的復活並操纵死者。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3944,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1320],[596]]},"end":182,"end_off":4114},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n嗯，就跟先前發生我們遇到的敵人一樣。\n&郭嘉\n但是由于目前魔王法力不足，\n所操纵的死着是不能见阳光的。\n&郭嘉\n除非……是在一个见不到阳光的地方。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":4114,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1320,596],[]]},"end":188,"end_off":4331},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n嗯，就跟先前發生我們遇到的敵人一樣。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n左慈在不久前也復活過死者呢。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n但是由于目前魔王法力不足，\n所操纵的死着是不能见阳光的。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n除非……是在一个见不到阳光的地方。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":4331,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[596],[1320]]},"end":191,"end_off":4409},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n左慈在不久前也復活過死者呢，\n他們確實行為相近。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n不论魔王有多厉害，\n我们都得消灭他。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,23,0,64,52,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n今夜將士們都累了。\n全軍暫且歇息，明日再與敵軍決戰！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n遵命，丞相。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n現在我軍已經疲憊不已，\n孔明很可能會趁夜偷襲，\n我們可千萬不能大意。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，仲達所言即是。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_act