op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":6562,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[2]},"end":59,"end_off":6618},{"op":105,"name":"popup","args":["敵軍能力130"]},{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,4033,2,0,130]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":6618,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[3]},"end":63,"end_off":6674},{"op":105,"name":"popup","args":["敵軍能力140"]},{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,4033,2,0,140]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[21,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[22,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":6720,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":6745,"body_end":7464,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[19]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n魔王是不會輕易放過這個偷襲我軍\n的機會的。如果我是他，我一定會\n這麼做。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，所以我們更不能大意呀。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n對了，上次張角他們使用了一種特殊的\n幡來攻擊我們。如果這個法術出自魔王\n，他這次可能也會使用這招。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n喔？會攻擊的幡？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n是的，但是請主公放心。\n只要我們把幡破壞到一定的程度，\n我就能將幡收走。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7090,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1320],[]]},"end":16,"end_off":7357},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[22,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n會攻擊的幡？我也曾在遁甲天書上看過，\n也知道這種幡的弱點。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[22,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n只要我在近處對著幡念咒文，\n便能將它們立即收走。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n哈哈，那麼就得偏勞你們二位了。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[22,0,3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7357,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1320]]},"end":21,"end_off":7456},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n哈哈，那麼就得偏勞你了，仲達。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":7464,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":7489,"body_end":7689,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[22]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n主公，我們上次在魚腹浦看到\n了諸葛亮的好幾個分身。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n萬一諸葛亮再次變出好幾個分身\n與我軍作戰，那是非常危險的！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。一個諸葛亮已經夠棘手了，\n更何況是好幾個呢。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":7689,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":7714,"body_end":7919,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[17]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n徐庶先生曾要求孔明交换条件，\n才答应帮孔明祈祷魔王复活的。\n&夏侯惇\n什么？到底是什么条件？\n&貂蝉\n徐庶先生只说不便告知……\n&夏侯惇\n嗯。\n事到如今也管不了许多了。\n&曹操\n……徐庶的条件？"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":7919,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":7944,"body_end":8470,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[804]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[804,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n我和貂蟬命運相連，同生共死；\n只要其中一人不死，另一人就能\n無限復活！"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,256]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n這麼神奇？那麼我們幾乎已經\n立於不敗之地了嘛。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[804,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n是的，所以還請丞相派貂蟬出戰，\n我會在旁給予協助。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,3,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n那真是太好了，昭姬！"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n呵呵，我會好好考慮的。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n另外，本關的我會裝備胡笳十八拍，\n可以施展補給與加能力策略，\n請多多運用。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[804,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":8470,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8495,"body_end":8642,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n关羽，你去过五丈原吗？\n&关羽\n很遗憾，关某并未去过。\n因为关某先前一直守卫着荆州。\n&曹操\n原来是这么回事。\n哈，我不该问你的。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":8642,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8667,"body_end":8943,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[16]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&典韦\n先前一直都沒有機會暴揍諸葛亮，\n我很遺憾！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n典韋將軍，我可以明白你的心情。\n但是諸葛軍師是無辜的，\n千錯萬錯都是魔王的錯。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n如果可以的話，關某希望能夠只殺死\n魔王，讓諸葛軍師恢復原狀……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n但願可以……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":8943,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8968,"body_end":9044,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n看來今晚會很不平靜。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，我也如此認為。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":9044,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":9069,"body_end":9325,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[157]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n您好，您現在玩的遊戲版本是\n新改曹操傳6.6，作者是jimmy200570\n也許以後會做進一步的更新。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n咦？為什麼您會忽然講這個呀？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n沒什麼，稍微講一下而已。\n呵、呵、呵。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&蔡琰\n(玩家又無法觸發這個對話，\n這樣做有意義嗎？)"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":9325,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":9350,"body_end":9587,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[23]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n听说在阳平关得到了穿雲箭！\n&曹操\n嗯。\n如此一来，弓兵得到大大的增強了。\n&贾诩\n穿雲箭是由弓兵或弓騎兵部队使用的。\n&贾诩\n據說它的威力可以射穿雲霄。\n受傷者背後的部隊亦會受到影響。\n&夏侯惇\n这么说来这玩意儿还挺管用的！"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":10,"offset":9587,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":9612,"body_end":9717,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[20]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n我軍的營寨附近都是山，行動並不方便。\n南面還有一條河，已經有些敵軍集結在\n那裡了。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}